{"answer":"在 2026-09-29 的 OrbbecSDK 2.9.0 C++ 示例中，先通过 USB 枚举或网络 IP:8090 打开设备，检查 OB_STRUCT_MULTI_DEVICE_SYNC_CONFIG 的读写权限，再读 getSupportedMultiDeviceSyncModeBitmap 返回的 uint16_t 位图；仅当位图包含 PRIMARY 和 SECONDARY 时，示例才调用 setMultiDeviceSyncMode。示例提示固件至少 1.1.9，但具体设备与固件组合仍需单独验证。","build":"20260929","code_tokens":["EXIT_FAILURE","OB_MULTI_DEVICE_SYNC_MODE_PRIMARY","OB_MULTI_DEVICE_SYNC_MODE_SECONDARY","OB_PERMISSION_READ","OB_PERMISSION_WRITE","OB_STRUCT_MULTI_DEVICE_SYNC_CONFIG","c_str","ob_device_get_supported_multi_device_sync_mode_bitmap","ob_error","shared_ptr","static_cast","uint16_t","uint32_t"],"confidence":"code_verified","doc_type":"example","kb_id":"daq-sdk-host-sync-001","last_verified":"2026-10-15","package":"host_cpp_20260929","platform":"Linux x86_64","question_patterns":["EGO SDK 怎么设置 PRIMARY SECONDARY 主从同步","多机同步模式如何检查固件支持","getSupportedMultiDeviceSyncModeBitmap 怎么用"],"sdk_layer":"host_cpp","source_refs":[{"archive_path":"SDK/SDK&OrbbecViewer_v2.9.0_20260929/linux/OrbbecSDK_v2.9.0_202609291326_7947205a_linux_x86_64.tar.gz","end_line":125,"member":"OrbbecSDK_v2.9.0_202609291326_7947205a_linux_x86_64/examples/src/6.ego/ego_multi_device_sync.cpp","member_sha256":"26fa19b2f19bd745021bd7d0eb5a679049a17d8f5449e3f573f953cf0a9c4a84","package_sha256":"1f44085be2283d41fc295b3c804cd89a2c856ad343d11f6dc674d64cf04a90f9","start_line":88},{"archive_path":"SDK/SDK&OrbbecViewer_v2.9.0_20260929/linux/OrbbecSDK_v2.9.0_202609291326_7947205a_linux_x86_64.tar.gz","end_line":65,"member":"OrbbecSDK_v2.9.0_202609291326_7947205a_linux_x86_64/examples/src/6.ego/ego_multi_device_sync.cpp","member_sha256":"26fa19b2f19bd745021bd7d0eb5a679049a17d8f5449e3f573f953cf0a9c4a84","package_sha256":"1f44085be2283d41fc295b3c804cd89a2c856ad343d11f6dc674d64cf04a90f9","start_line":62},{"archive_path":"SDK/SDK&OrbbecViewer_v2.9.0_20260929/linux/OrbbecSDK_v2.9.0_202609291326_7947205a_linux_x86_64.tar.gz","end_line":148,"member":"OrbbecSDK_v2.9.0_202609291326_7947205a_linux_x86_64/examples/src/6.ego/ego_mul